  "title": {
   "en": "1995 Youth Report"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "1995 청춘 레포트"
   },
   {
    "ja": "1995年の青春レポート"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Spring of 1995 at Korea University. In a liberal arts class, business student and sloppy handwriting model student, Do Jin-woo, and beautifully-handwriting physical education student, Lee Dae-han, meet by chance. After some misunderstandings and bickering, Jin-woo is stunned: 'Did Lee Dae-han just recognize my handwriting at once?' When Dae-han immediately identifies Jin-woo's rejected report, dismissed due to his bad handwriting, Jin-woo asks him to rewrite it. In return, Dae-han, who has repeatedly failed at dating, asks Jin-woo, the business department's heartthrob, for 'dating lessons'...?!"
  },
